1
00:00:00,258 --> 00:00:01,928
Amy, wait!

2
00:00:01,928 --> 00:00:04,428
(Sheldon:)Getting a turtle meant
a great deal to me, too.

3
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:05,930
(Raj:)Sure.

4
00:00:05,932 --> 00:00:07,762
(Amy:)Unless something
better comes along.

5
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:11,437
(Sheldon:)Do you want me
to withdraw my application?

6
00:00:11,437 --> 00:00:14,207
(Amy:)What I want is for us

7
00:00:14,207 --> 00:00:17,207
(Amy:)to be planning our
future together.

8
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:20,480
(Sheldon:)And in that future,

9
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,650
(Sheldon:)are we on the same planet?

10
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,350
Yeah, because I've seen people

11
00:00:26,352 --> 00:00:28,022
(Sheldon:)make the long-distance
thing work.

12
00:00:28,021 --> 00:00:29,791
We're on the same planet!
Okay!

13
00:00:32,457 --> 00:00:35,897
(Sheldon:)Does that planet have
to be Earth?

14
00:00:36,928 --> 00:00:39,498
(Amy:)Are you asking me to go
to Mars with you?

15
00:00:39,499 --> 00:00:41,099
(Sheldon:)I am.

16
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,730
(Sheldon:)Yeah, if I'm going
to a barren,

17
00:00:42,735 --> 00:00:44,735
(Sheldon:)lifeless environment,

18
00:00:44,737 --> 00:00:48,077
(Sheldon:)where the chances of survival
are slim to none,

19
00:00:48,074 --> 00:00:51,344
(Sheldon:)I want you there with me.

20
00:00:55,781 --> 00:00:57,651
(Sheldon:)Why don't we go back
to the apartment,

21
00:00:57,650 --> 00:01:00,020
(Sheldon:)and fill out your application?

